# CODEOWNERS - the required-approver list, enforced natively by GitHub.
#
# Every PR into a branch whose protection enables "require code owner review"
# (development, staging, main) must have an approving review from a code owner.
# The file is identical on every branch, so there is no drift to manage across promotions.
#
# NOTE: GitHub blocks approving your own PR, so with a single owner the owner's own PRs need
# either a second code owner added here or the code-owner-review requirement relaxed.
